[00:14.82]1. There was a time we did not know
[00:24.76]The way a Christian ought to go.
[00:32.32]Then Jehovah sent the light,
[00:37.64]His Kingdom truth so clear and bright.
[00:44.22]Our Father’s will we then could see
[00:50.78]To serve the grand Theocracy,
[00:57.38]To declare Jehovah’s fame,
[01:02.74]And help to glorify his holy name.
[01:08.80]We witness now to all we meet,
[01:14.94]From door to door and on the street.
[01:21.20]We take the time to help them see;
[01:27.52]We teach the truth that sets us free.
[01:33.82]And as we strive in ev’ry land
[01:40.26]Jehovah’s worship to expand,
[01:47.10]May we serve our God as one
[01:52.78]Until Jehovah says the work is done.
